        "title": "The table below shows the number of motor vehicles per 1,000 inhabitants in eight countries in 1990 and 2000. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make a comparison where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FZgndqCGMoah3jxVd8olhUpZgQe\"><em><strong>The table below shows the number of motor vehicles per 1,000 inhabitants in eight countries in 1990 and 2000.</strong> <strong>Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make a comparison where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Motor Vehicles per 1,000 People: 1990 vs 2000</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SaSKdM1JpoWdT8xr5WclDARzg0d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Motor Vehicles per 1,000 People: 1990 vs 2000 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả số lượng xe cơ giới tr&ecirc;n 1000 d&acirc;n tại 8 quốc gia v&agrave;o năm 1990 v&agrave; 2000.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xhs7d86SRoM5VWxMeeHl2lASgmc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch<a href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuyet-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"> <strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">tả số liệu 'tuyệt đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</span></strong></a> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Motor Vehicles per 1,000 People: 1990 vs 2000 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: số lượng xe cơ giới - tr&ecirc;n 1000 d&acirc;n - 8 quốc gia - 1990 đến 2000.</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D9n2dT6reoUXRNx42urlLISBgH9\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IGyjdCCmNoNsJMxOIIblTD7wgPh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>Bahamas giảm || Cambodia kh&ocirc;ng đổi || c&aacute;c nước kh&aacute;c tăng.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RhBGdssNdoh7nBxbXBElrx25g2e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>Brazil v&agrave; Romania tăng trưởng mạnh v&agrave; trở th&agrave;nh hai nước c&oacute; mật độ phương tiện cao nhất v&agrave;o năm 2000.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SX0BduN3Colr0qxzGQjl2lytg0e\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Luxembourg, New Zealand, v&agrave; Bahamas</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A0kDdgTi5oHVmsx4oORlw6WqgNg\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SdA9dej7VoHBCoxVE0Rlt3B1guf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1990 </strong><em>(Luxembourg</em><em><strong> </strong>dẫn đầu</em><em> với 548 phương tiện tr&ecirc;n 1000 d&acirc;n, </em><em>cao hơn một ch&uacute;t</em><em> </em><em>so với New Zealand l&agrave; 531, trong khi Bahamas</em><em><strong> </strong>thấp hơn đ&aacute;ng kể</em><em> với 235)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KSN8dcROJosQPAx95vnljf1xgHg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Luxembourg </strong><em>(</em><em>tăng</em><em> l&ecirc;n 728 v&agrave;o 2000)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TjoNdwSJyoCg5yxqm8ZlTX0KgVh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của New Zealand </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>tăng nhẹ</strong></em><em> l&ecirc;n 557 v&agrave;o 2000)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fh8WdiL8Uov8qvxQ0bRlfxWVgmd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 4) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Bahamas </strong><em>(</em><em>giảm</em><em> xuống 187 v&agrave;o 2000)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SCSwdax9tomUUSxefRElcRiTgHc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: </strong><strong>Cambodia, Jordan, Brazil, Chile,</strong> <strong>v&agrave; </strong><strong>Romania</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SCSwdax9tomUUSxefRElcRiTgHc\">Theo<strong> Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SCSwdax9tomUUSxefRElcRiTgHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RAoHdZC6xoXQyCxMn2VlpYiRgXf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>(</strong>Step 1)&nbsp;<strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1990 </strong><em>(Cambodia</em><em><strong> </strong></em><em>với 1 phương tiện tr&ecirc;n 1000 d&acirc;n,<strong> </strong></em><em>trong khi </em><em>Jordan, Brazil, Chile, v&agrave; Romania c&oacute;<strong> </strong></em><em>số lượng tương đương</em><em>, từ 50 đến 70)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vmo0duJUtoBQtgxIne1lr2Dcgle\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Brazil v&agrave; Romania </strong><em>(Brazil </em><em>thay đổi đ&aacute;ng kể nhất</em><em>, </em><em><strong>tăng mạnh</strong></em><em> l&ecirc;n 13,580 phương tiện v&agrave;o 2000, </em><em>theo sau</em><em> l&agrave; Romania với 8,012 phương tiện v&agrave;o 2000)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hx0CdCFwqoCtGLx5ZsElTd6Gg7d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Jordan v&agrave; Chile </strong><em>(</em><em>tăng &iacute;t hơn</em><em>, với số lượng phương tiện của Jordan tăng l&ecirc;n 157 v&agrave; Chile tăng l&ecirc;n 88 v&agrave;o 2000)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QJ4AdlSyToYtlixeyK1l0rNKgge\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 4) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Cambodia </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>giữ nguy&ecirc;n</strong> 1 phương tiện v&agrave;o 2000)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOGCdDfzMo4b0vxNcTDlMZwkgW6\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bc2gdrij0o2chcxcadllSjTsgke\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XdYcdsZ6Uo6tuXxGPs3lNnJUgHh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DKR6dLMaeoXxeTxrXRSlEEvNg0c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O8R9dk6Xvol5aLxlleWlaa4bgXf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Để diễn tả mức&nbsp;<strong>sở hữu xe b&igrave;nh qu&acirc;n đầu người</strong> m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể sử dụng c&aacute;c cụm từ như \"<strong>vehicle ownership</strong>\" hay \"<strong>vehicle density</strong>\" để c&acirc;u văn m&igrave;nh đa dạng hơn nh&eacute;.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HozVdwmnrodY6ex1cBGlxxvsgdb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ: </strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WsstdOCqoohAaRx0IedlZoKggJe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Overall, most countries witnessed an increase in <strong>vehicle ownership</strong> during this period, with the exception of the Bahamas and Cambodia, where the figures fell and remained unchanged respectively. In addition, Brazil and Romania experienced extraordinary growth to become countries with the highest <strong>vehicle density</strong> by 2000.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 459,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Chs2dcCPIogyLrxTgIJl6tArgrg\">The table illustrates the number of motor vehicles per thousand people in eight different countries in 1990 and 2000.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13802,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 460,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RTgydKcRloeHljxNRrGlaMWXgvb\">Overall, most countries witnessed an increase in vehicle ownership during this period, with the exception of the Bahamas and Cambodia, where the figures fell and remained unchanged respectively. In addition, Brazil and Romania experienced extraordinary growth to become countries with the highest vehicle density by 2000.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13802,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 461,
            "sort": 3,
